Description: libminkadaptor: Set library version to 1.0.0
 libminkadaptor declares VERSION 0.1.0 in its project() call, so it is
 installed as libminkadaptor.so.0.1.0 with SONAME libminkadaptor.so.0.
 All other shipped libraries in this repository (libminkteec,
 libfsservice, libgpfsservice, librpmbservice, libtaautoload and
 libtimeservice) use VERSION 1.0.0 and install as .so.1.
 .
 Bump libminkadaptor to 1.0.0 so it is consistent with the other
 libraries and gets a stable SOVERSION of 1 for distribution packaging.
Author: Ali Erdinc Koroglu <ali.koroglu@oss.qualcomm.com>
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/qualcomm/minkipc/commit/a41e5d8af4e2d63bf8affaee947eccf72553ec16
Applied-Upstream: https://github.com/qualcomm/minkipc/pull/95, a41e5d8af4e2d63bf8affaee947eccf72553ec16
Last-Update: 2026-10-12
---
--- a/libminkadaptor/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/libminkadaptor/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 project(libminkadaptor
-	VERSION 0.1.0
+	VERSION 1.0.0
 	LANGUAGES C ASM
 )
 
